{
  "key": 19961,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0974_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_HALL_Academy_Text_NadiaHello",
      "en_US": [
        "Nadia: Nimbasa City, Unova.\n",
        "Elesa’s my idol… and my rival,\r",
        "honestly.\r",
        "There’s only one Electric Gym\n",
        "there. So I’m here to get good\r",
        "enough that Unova needs two."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0974_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_HALL_Academy_Text_Reader1",
      "en_US": [
        "Shh! I’m reading about speed\n",
        "tiers. There’s a whole shelf on\r",
        "Pokémon that move at exactly\n",
        "100!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0974_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_HALL_Academy_Text_Reader2",
      "en_US": [
        "Every Gym in every region sends\n",
        "its battle records here. I could\r",
        "read in this library forever."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0974_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_HALL_Academy_Text_MegaDoorGuard",
      "en_US": [
        "The Mega Evolution room is only\n",
        "for trainers who carry a Key\r",
        "Stone.\r",
        "The headmaster decides who’s\n",
        "ready. Collect all eight of\r",
        "Kanto’s Badges, and maybe she’ll\n",
        "decide it’s you!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0974_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_HALL_Academy_Text_BraceletCall",
      "en_US": [
        "Wisteria: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! A moment, if\n",
        "you please. Come up to my desk."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0974_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_HALL_Academy_Text_Bracelet1",
      "en_US": [
        "Wisteria: Eight Badges. Every\n",
        "Gym in Kanto. I’d say you’ve\r",
        "learned all a lecture hall can\n",
        "teach you.\r",
        "But there’s one more thing a Gym\n",
        "Leader should know. Have you\r",
        "heard of Mega Evolution?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0974_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_HALL_Academy_Text_Bracelet2",
      "en_US": [
        "When the bond between a trainer\n",
        "and a Pokémon runs deep enough,\r",
        "a Mega Stone and a Key Stone\n",
        "together let it change, for one\r",
        "battle, into something far\n",
        "stronger.\r",
        "This is my own Mega Bracelet.\n",
        "Its Key Stone has waited a long\r",
        "time for a trainer worth it.\n",
        "Take it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0974_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_HALL_Academy_Text_Bracelet3",
      "en_US": [
        "The door behind me leads to the\n",
        "Mega Evolution room. Primrose\r",
        "keeps the Academy’s Mega Stones\n",
        "there.\r",
        "She doesn’t simply hand them\n",
        "out, mind you. A stone has to\r",
        "choose you. She’ll explain."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0974_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_HALL_Academy_Text_HeadmasterHello",
      "en_US": [
        "Wisteria: Ah, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}. You have\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} BP. What can I tell\r",
        "you about?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0974_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_HALL_Academy_Text_OptBP",
      "en_US": "Battle Points"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0974_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_HALL_Academy_Text_OptHall",
      "en_US": "Battle Hall"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0974_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_HALL_Academy_Text_OptCandidates",
      "en_US": "Candidates"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0974_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_HALL_Academy_Text_OptTeachers",
      "en_US": "Instructors"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0974_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_HALL_Academy_Text_OptBye",
      "en_US": "That’s All"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0974_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_HALL_Academy_Text_HeadmasterBye",
      "en_US": [
        "Off you go, then. A Gym Leader\n",
        "never stops learning."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0974_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_HALL_Academy_Text_CandidateAsk",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} ({STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0},\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}): A practice battle,\r",
        "for BP?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0974_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_HALL_gGymChallengeIntroText",
      "en_US": "(missing text)"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0974_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_HALL_Academy_Text_CandidateHealed",
      "en_US": [
        "Your Pokémon were patched up\n",
        "after the practice match."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0974_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_HALL_Academy_Text_HeadmasterBP",
      "en_US": [
        "BP are Battle Points. You earn\n",
        "them in practice: a win against\r",
        "another candidate, an\n",
        "Instructor’s demonstration, or a\r",
        "streak in the Battle Hall.\r",
        "The Market’s carts sell TMs,\n",
        "held items and Mints for BP. But\r",
        "every one of them takes money,\n",
        "too: tell the cashier at the\r",
        "gate which."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0974_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_HALL_Academy_Text_HeadmasterHall",
      "en_US": [
        "In the Battle Hall, you borrow\n",
        "three Pokémon from a list of\r",
        "six. Your own team waits safely\n",
        "with the clerk.\r",
        "Win and you keep going, and the\n",
        "BP grows with your streak. Lose,\r",
        "and you simply start again."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0974_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_HALL_Academy_Text_HeadmasterCandidates",
      "en_US": [
        "Candidates come here from Johto,\n",
        "Hoenn, Sinnoh, Unova, Kalos,\r",
        "Alola, Galar and Paldea.\r",
        "Some are just starting out. Some\n",
        "could take a Gym tomorrow. All\r",
        "of them will battle you, as\n",
        "often as you like."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0974_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_HALL_Academy_Text_HeadmasterTeachers",
      "en_US": [
        "Each of my Instructors is named\n",
        "for a flower, as I am. It’s a\r",
        "tradition here.\r",
        "Their lecture halls are through\n",
        "the doors behind me. In A,\r",
        "Larkspur teaches speed control\n",
        "and Camellia setup. In B,\r",
        "Foxglove spread moves and\n",
        "Verbena positioning.\r",
        "In C, Marigold weather and\n",
        "Hyacinth targeting. In D, Yarrow\r",
        "training and Tansy team\n",
        "building.\r",
        "All of it for double battles,\n",
        "mind you. That’s where Gym\r",
        "battles are going."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0974_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_HALL_Academy_Text_CandidateLater",
      "en_US": "Anytime. I’ll be here."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0974_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_HALL_gGymChallengeWinText",
      "en_US": "(missing text)"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0974_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_HALL_Academy_Text_EarnedBP",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} earned {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} BP!\n",
        "(Total: {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} BP)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0974_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_HALL_cv_unported",
      "en_US": [
        "(Canvas DS: this part of the game\n",
        "isn’t ported yet.)"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
